{"content":[{"c":["HOUSEHOLD"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Persons who live in the same place and compose a family or extended family. In biblical times a household included father, mother(s), children, grandparents, servants, concubines, and sojourners. Jacob’s household, for example, included 66 people, not counting the wives of his sons (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.26","r":"Gen.46.26","rawR":"Gen.46.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.26","value":"Gen.46.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 46:26"},"). Households were seen as corporately responsible for the honor of the family (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.3.27","r":"2Sam.3.27","rawR":"2Sam.3.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.3.27","value":"2Sam.3.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 3:27"}," gives an example of revenge by a household). Male members of the entire household were circumcised as a sign of the covenant (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.17.23","r":"Gen.17.23","rawR":"Gen.17.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.17.23","value":"Gen.17.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 17:23"},"). In the NT era, some entire households were baptized (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.11.14","r":"Acts.11.14","rawR":"Acts.11.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.11.14","value":"Acts.11.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 11:14"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=FamilyLifeandRelations_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"FamilyLifeandRelations_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"FamilyLifeandRelations_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Family Life and Relations"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Household","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 46:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.46.26","rawQueryValue":"Gen.46.26","sourceRefExact":"Gen.46.26"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 3:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.3.27","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.3.27","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.3.27"},{"anchorText":"Gn 17:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.17.23","rawQueryValue":"Gen.17.23","sourceRefExact":"Gen.17.23"},{"anchorText":"Acts 11:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.11.14","rawQueryValue":"Acts.11.14","sourceRefExact":"Acts.11.14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0300c8cc50586a1575a664bef4c727fa6957128984d432993b005918cbfc6a59","sourceItemName":"Household","sourceItemOrder":376,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Household","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Household","title":"Household","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}